### Test 1: Signup a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testpassword123"
}

### Test 2: Verify email (replace TOKEN with the token from email)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/verify-email?token=TOKEN

### Test 3: SignIn with MFA (returns MFA token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testpassword123"
}

> {%
client.global.set("mfaToken", response.body.token);
%}

### Test 4: Verify OTP and get final JWT (replace OTP with the code from email)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/otp-signin?otp=123456
Authorization: Bearer {{mfaToken}}

> {%
client.global.set("jwt", response.body.token);
%}

### Test 5: Access private API with final JWT
GET http://localhost:8080/api/private/user
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Test 6: Access manager endpoint with final JWT (should fail for regular user)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/maintenance/test
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
